 d&apos;information sur le site web d&apos;Eurostat</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="de">Mehr Informationen auf der Eurostat Website</dct:title></foaf:Document></dcat:landingPage><foaf:page><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/cache/metadata/en/ei_bp_esms.htm"><dct:title xml:lang="en">ESMS metadata (Euro-SDMX Metadata structure) HTML</dct:title><foaf:topic rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/teibp020"/><schema:url xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/cache/metadata/en/ei_bp_esms.htm]]></schema:url><dct:format rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/HTML"/><dcat:mediaType rdf:resource="http://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/text/html"/><dct:type><skos:Concept rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/documentation-type/DOCUMENTATION_MAIN"/></dct:type></foaf:Document></foaf:page><foaf:page><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/files?file=metadata/ei_bp_esms.sdmx.zip"><dct:title xml:lang="en">ESMS metadata (Euro-SDMX Metadata structure) SDMX</dct:title><foaf:topic rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/teibp020"/><schema:url xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/files?file=metadata/ei_bp_esms.sdmx.zip]]></schema:url><dct:format rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/XML"/><dcat:mediaType rdf:resource="http://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/application/xml"/><dct:type><skos:Concept rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/documentation-type/DOCUMENTATION_MAIN"/></dct:type></foaf:Document></foaf:page><dcat:distribution><dcat:Distribution rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/view/teibp020/default/table"><dct:title xml:lang="en">Table, graphs and map visualizations are also available.</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Des visualisations sous forme de tableau, graphique et carte gé